      "descriptionHtml": "<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Fabric:</strong> Soft cotton-blend knit with 65% cotton in the main fabric.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Family story:</strong> One cozy Christmas pajama look for mom, dad, and the kids, made for tree trimming, Christmas morning, and family photos.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Print:</strong> Black tops with sky-blue neck trim and cuffs show a reindeer in a colorful striped scarf with Christmas ornaments hanging from its antlers, and the pants are a blue and black plaid.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Design details:</strong> Long-sleeve crew-neck top with ribbed cuffs, plus full-length pants with an elastic waist and cuffed ankles.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Care:</strong> Follow the care label sewn into each garment.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Size range:</strong> Child 2 Years through Child 14 Years, Mother S through Mother 3XL, and Father S through Father 3XL.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Size Chart - Pajama Set</h3>\n<table id=\"size-chart\" class=\"size-chart\">\n<thead><tr>\n<th>Size</th>\n<th>Age</th>\n<th>Weight (kg)</th>\n<th>Height (cm)</th>\n<th>Chest/Bust (cm)</th>\n<th>Sleeve (cm)</th>\n<th>Pant/Short (cm)</th>\n<th>Hip (cm)</th>\n<th>Waist (cm)</th>\n<th>Garment Length (cm)</th>\n</tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 2 Years</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>61.5 cm</td>\n<td>30 cm</td>\n<td>52 cm</td>\n<td>64 cm</td>\n<td>42 cm</td>\n<td>36 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 3 Years</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>64.5 cm</td>\n<td>33 cm</td>\n<td>57 cm</td>\n<td>67 cm</td>\n<td>44 cm</td>\n<td>39 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 4 Years</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>67 cm</td>\n<td>35.5 cm</td>\n<td>62 cm</td>\n<td>70 cm</td>\n<td>46 cm</td>\n<td>41 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 5 Years</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>69.5 cm</td>\n<td>38 cm</td>\n<td>66 cm</td>\n<td>73 cm</td>\n<td>48 cm</td>\n<td>43 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 6 Years</td>\n<td>6-7</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>72.5 cm</td>\n<td>40.5 cm</td>\n<td>72 cm</td>\n<td>76 cm</td>\n<td>50 cm</td>\n<td>46 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 8 Years</td>\n<td>8-9</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>79.5 cm</td>\n<td>45.5 cm</td>\n<td>78 cm</td>\n<td>82 cm</td>\n<td>53 cm</td>\n<td>52 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 10 Years</td>\n<td>10-11</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>86.5 cm</td>\n<td>50.5 cm</td>\n<td>87 cm</td>\n<td>88 cm</td>\n<td>56 cm</td>\n<td>58 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 12 Years</td>\n<td>11-12</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>93.5 cm</td>\n<td>55 cm</td>\n<td>93 cm</td>\n<td>94 cm</td>\n<td>60 cm</td>\n<td>63 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 14 Years</td>\n<td>13-14</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>100.5 cm</td>\n<td>59 cm</td>\n<td>99 cm</td>\n<td>100 cm</td>\n<td>64 cm</td>\n<td>68 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother S</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>98 cm</td>\n<td>59 cm</td>\n<td>103 cm</td>\n<td>104 cm</td>\n<td>68 cm</td>\n<td>63 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother M</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>102 cm</td>\n<td>60 cm</td>\n<td>104.5 cm</td>\n<td>108 cm</td>\n<td>72 cm</td>\n<td>64 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother L</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>108 cm</td>\n<td>61 cm</td>\n<td>106 cm</td>\n<td>114 cm</td>\n<td>77 cm</td>\n<td>65 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother XL</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>114 cm</td>\n<td>62 cm</td>\n<td>107 cm</td>\n<td>120 cm</td>\n<td>82 cm</td>\n<td>66 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother 2XL</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>120 cm</td>\n<td>63 cm</td>\n<td>108 cm</td>\n<td>126 cm</td>\n<td>87 cm</td>\n<td>67 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother 3XL</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>126 cm</td>\n<td>64 cm</td>\n<td>109 cm</td>\n<td>132 cm</td>\n<td>93 cm</td>\n<td>68 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Father S</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>106 cm</td>\n<td>63 cm</td>\n<td>104 cm</td>\n<td>106 cm</td>\n<td>73 cm</td>\n<td>70 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Father M</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>111 cm</td>\n<td>65 cm</td>\n<td>105.5 cm</td>\n<td>111 cm</td>\n<td>78 cm</td>\n<td>72 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Father L</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>117 cm</td>\n<td>67 cm</td>\n<td>107 cm</td>\n<td>117 cm</td>\n<td>83 cm</td>\n<td>74 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Father XL</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>123 cm</td>\n<td>68 cm</td>\n<td>108.5 cm</td>\n<td>125 cm</td>\n<td>90 cm</td>\n<td>76 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Father 2XL</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>129 cm</td>\n<td>69 cm</td>\n<td>110 cm</td>\n<td>133 cm</td>\n<td>97 cm</td>\n<td>77 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Father 3XL</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>135 cm</td>\n<td>70 cm</td>\n<td>111 cm</td>\n<td>141 cm</td>\n<td>104 cm</td>\n<td>78 cm</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>The whole family can wear the same Christmas pajama set, with child, women's, and men's sizes. Pick a size for each family member separately to build your matching look.</p>\n\n<p>Each size is one two-piece set with a top and pants. Garment length is the top length; pant length is the full pants length. The waist is elastic; the chart shows the relaxed waist measurement. Measurements are approximate, so compare chest, waist, and lengths with pajamas that fit well today.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Whole-family match:</strong> The same Christmas pajama set in child sizes plus women's and men's cuts.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Ornament reindeer:</strong> A cheerful reindeer with ornaments on its antlers, paired with bright blue plaid pants.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft knit:</strong> A soft cotton-blend knit for cozy winter bedtimes.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Photo-ready:</strong> Coordinated colors made for Christmas cards and holiday photos.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Full family size range:</strong> Nine child sizes, six women's sizes, and six men's sizes; see the size chart for measurements.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Choose the sizes you need for a cozy family Christmas.</p>",
